1
00:00:00,161 --> 00:00:02,511
Anthropic just launched Claude Duet

2
00:00:02,531 --> 00:00:04,575
An AI that keeps working for you

3
00:00:04,595 --> 00:00:06,398
even when your laptop is off

4
00:00:06,561 --> 00:00:08,640
It's not a chatbot you ask questions

5
00:00:08,660 --> 00:00:09,595
It's an agent

6
00:00:09,615 --> 00:00:12,567
It checks your email calendar and apps every

7
00:00:12,587 --> 00:00:14,701
few hours and only comes to you when

8
00:00:14,721 --> 00:00:15,923
something needs you

9
00:00:16,128 --> 00:00:17,086
Every morning

10
00:00:17,106 --> 00:00:18,773
it sends you a short brief

11
00:00:18,793 --> 00:00:21,155
What's urgent what's waiting and what it already

12
00:00:21,175 --> 00:00:22,141
prepared

13
00:00:22,361 --> 00:00:23,768
Then it actually does the work

14
00:00:23,788 --> 00:00:25,690
Follow-ups meeting prep

15
00:00:25,710 --> 00:00:28,143
even full decks and dashboards as files you

16
00:00:28,163 --> 00:00:28,952
can edit

17
00:00:29,161 --> 00:00:31,193
But it never sends pays

18
00:00:31,213 --> 00:00:34,231
signs or deletes anything without your OK

19
00:00:34,461 --> 00:00:35,561
Now the rivals

20
00:00:35,581 --> 00:00:37,302
Meta's Muse is free

21
00:00:37,327 --> 00:00:39,205
but built for personal errands

22
00:00:39,225 --> 00:00:41,599
Grok Bot needs an X subscription

23
00:00:41,619 --> 00:00:42,979
from 30 dollars

24
00:00:42,999 --> 00:00:46,146
OpenAI's Dots starts at 100 dollars a month

25
00:00:46,361 --> 00:00:49,784
Duet comes inside Claude Pro at 20 dollars

26
00:00:49,804 --> 00:00:51,129
And it already knows you

27
00:00:51,149 --> 00:00:54,383
Your memory skills and connected apps carry straight

28
00:00:54,403 --> 00:00:55,157
over

29
00:00:55,361 --> 00:00:56,138
To get it

30
00:00:56,234 --> 00:00:58,855
join the waitlist on claude.com with your Claude

31
00:00:58,875 --> 00:00:59,692
email

32
00:00:59,712 --> 00:01:02,004
When your invite lands open the Duet app

33
00:01:02,024 --> 00:01:03,607
or claude.ai

34
00:01:03,627 --> 00:01:05,612
Start with one job and only the apps

35
00:01:05,632 --> 00:01:06,610
it needs

36
00:01:06,828 --> 00:01:07,680
The catch

37
00:01:07,700 --> 00:01:10,216
It's a US-only preview for Pro and Max

38
00:01:10,236 --> 00:01:12,711
and background work uses your plan limits

39
00:01:12,928 --> 00:01:15,219
Muse Grok Bot Dots or Duet

40
00:01:15,239 --> 00:01:17,118
Which one would you trust with your inbox

41
00:01:17,138 --> 00:01:18,528
Tell me in the comments
